<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82513" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίφρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, voc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίφρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.435
				</span></i>
			, etc., but=nom., <i><span class="en">
				19.357
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.381
			</span></i> : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρήν</span>):—<i>very
				thoughtful, very careful</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> of Penelope, <i><span class="en">
				16.435
			</span></i>,al.; of other women, <i><span class="en">
				11.345
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19.357
			</span></i>, once in <i><span class="en">Il., 5.412</span></i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				3.45
			</span></i>; also of Hephaestus, first in <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				297
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				313
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					894
				</span></i>
			; <i>artful, crafty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.205
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>haughty, overweening</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				757
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίφρονα δ᾽ ἔλακες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1426
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			gen., <i>despising</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					8.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
